  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 30 * 6 * 5 * 4 * 2 * 27\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1) ÷, ×, +, –, =\n\n30 * 6 * 5 * 4 * 2 * 27 ⇒ 30 ÷ 6 × 5 + 4 - 2 = 27\n\n⇒ __**30 ÷**____** 6**__ × 5 + 4 - 2 = 27\n\n⇒ __**5**____** ×**____** 5**__ + 4 - 2 = 27\n\n⇒ __**25**____** + 4**__ - 2 = 27\n\n⇒ __2____9** - 2**__ = 27\n\n**⇒ 27 = 27 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2) +, –, ×, ÷, =\n\n30 * 6 * 5 * 4 * 2 * 27 ⇒ 30 + 6 - 5 × 4 ÷ 2 = 27\n\n⇒ 30 + 6 - 5 × __**4 **____**÷**____** 2**__ = 27\n\n⇒ 30 + 6 - __**5 **____**× 2**__ = 27\n\n⇒ __**30 + 6**__ - 10 = 27\n\n⇒ __36** - 10**__ = 27\n\n⇒ 26 ≠ 27 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) +, ×, –, =, ÷ \n\n30 * 6 * 5 * 4 * 2 * 27 ⇒ 30 + 6 × 5 - 4 = 2 ÷ 27\n\n⇒ 30 + __**6 **____**×**____** 5**__ - 4 = __**2 **____**÷ 27**__\n\n⇒ __**30 + 30**__ - 4 = 0.07\n\n⇒ __60____** - 4**__ = 0.07\n\n⇒ 56 ≠ 0.07 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) +, ×, –, ÷,=\n\n30 * 6 * 5 * 4 * 2 * 27 ⇒ 30 + 6 × 5 - 4 ÷ 2 = 27\n\n⇒ 30 + 6 × 5 - __**4 **____**÷**____** 2**__ = 27\n\n⇒ 30 + __**6 **____**×**____** 5**__ - 2 = 27\n\n⇒ __**30 + 30**__ - 2 = 27\n\n⇒ 58 ≠ 27 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
